---
import Wordmark from './ui/Wordmark.astro';
import IconArrowUpRight from './icons/IconArrowUpRight.astro';
---

<footer>
  <div class="tc-container">
    <div class="site-footer__inner">
      <div class="site-footer__brand">
        <Wordmark size="lg" />
        <p>
          "Fais le ou ne le fais pas. Il n'y a pas d'essai." — Yoda après 10 prompts à Claude qui n'arrive pas à corriger le responsive et qui dit "Je vais essayer une autre approche.".
        </p>
      </div>

      <nav aria-label="Pages">
        <h2>Pages</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/#competences">Compétences</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#projets">Projets</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#talks">Conférences</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#blog">Blog</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <nav aria-label="Ailleurs">
        <h2>Ailleurs</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a class="footer-extlink" href="https://github.com/tentacode" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub 
              <IconArrowUpRight aria-hidden="true" /><span class="tc-sr">, nouvelle fenêtre</span></a></li>
          <li><a class="footer-extlink" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gabrielpillet" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn
              <IconArrowUpRight aria-hidden="true" /><span class="tc-sr">, nouvelle fenêtre</span></a></li>
          <li><a class="footer-extlink" href="https://bsky.app/profile/tentacode.bsky.social" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bluesky
              <IconArrowUpRight aria-hidden="true" /><span class="tc-sr">, nouvelle fenêtre</span></a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <nav aria-label="Contact">
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="mailto:bonjour@tentacode.dev">bonjour@tentacode.dev</a></li>
          <li>
            <a class="footer-extlink" href="https://tentacode.github.io/curriculum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Curriculum Vitae en ligne, nouvelle fenêtre">
              CV en ligne
              <IconArrowUpRight aria-hidden="true" />
            </a>
          </li>
          <li><a href="/mentions-legales">Mentions légales</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="site-footer__legal">
      <span>© 2026 Gabriel Pillet — fait avec soin (et mon pote Claude aussi).</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  footer {
    background: var(--tc-fg-1); color: var(--tc-bg);
    padding: var(--tc-space-8) 0 var(--tc-space-6);
  }
  .site-footer__inner {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--tc-space-6);
  }
  .site-footer__brand { max-width: 30ch; }
  .site-footer__brand p {
    margin: var(--tc-space-3) 0 0;
    font-size: 14px; color: #C8BFBC; line-height: 1.55;
  }

  nav h2 {
    font-size: 11px; color: var(--tc-accent-soft);
    margin: 0 0 var(--tc-space-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-weight: var(--tc-weight-semibold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-family: var(--tc-font-sans);
  }
  nav ul {
    list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
  }
  nav a {
    color: var(--tc-bg); text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
  }
  nav a:hover,
  nav a:focus-visible { text-decoration: underline; }
  nav a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--tc-accent); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 2px; }

  .footer-extlink { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
  .footer-extlink :global(svg) { width: 12px; height: 12px; opacity: 0.7; }
  .footer-extlink:hover :global(svg) { opacity: 1; }

  .site-footer__legal {
    margin-top: var(--tc-space-7); padding-top: var(--tc-space-4);
    border-top: 1px solid #2A2A2A;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--tc-space-4);
    font-family: var(--tc-font-mono); font-size: 12px; color: #888;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1080px) {
    .site-footer__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .site-footer__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .site-footer__legal { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  }
</style>
